    <bpmn:process id="W_W3977" name="W3977. Corporate Development &amp; Growth Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Capital Allocation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategy (links to VS-33.1); board direction; capital plan
Frequency: Annual + on direction
Volume: Enterprise corporate-development strategy
Owner: Head of Corporate Development / CEO
Participants: Corp Dev, Strategy (links to VS-33), Finance/Treasury (links to VS-17.4/VS-18), Board (links to VS-36), business-unit leaders, Legal (links to VS-100)
Source: workflow W3977 — Corporate Development &amp; Growth Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Capital Allocation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3977_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3977_Lane1" name="Corp Dev">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3977_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3977_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3977_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3977_Lane2" name="CEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3977_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3977_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3977_Start4" name="Annual strategy (links to VS-33.1); board direction; capital plan">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3977_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3977_Task5" name="Corp Dev/Strategy define the corporate-development strategy aligned to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev/Strategy define the corporate-development strategy aligned to enterprise strategy (links to VS-33.1): growth objectives (geographic — new Philippine regions; capability — installation/design/B2B/digital/fintech; category — adjacencies), portfolio lens (which businesses/categories to grow/hold/divest), and the role of M&amp;A/JV vs organic (links to VS-37)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3977_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3977_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3977_Task6" name="Corp Dev/Finance establish the capital-allocation framework for transactions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corp Dev/Finance establish the capital-allocation framework for transactions: capex vs M&amp;A vs shareholder returns, financing capacity (cash, debt links to VS-18, equity), risk appetite, and the impact on the 5-entity structure and consolidation (links to VS-72)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Finance / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3977_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3977_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3977_Task7" name="CEO/Board ratify the strategy, approve the corporate-development mandate and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CEO/Board ratify the strategy, approve the corporate-development mandate and budget, and set decision rights/governance (links to W3983)
Responsible (R): CEO / Board
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3977_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3977_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3977_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3977_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3977_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-620 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Development Strategy, Pipeline &amp; Target Identification (PA-130.1).) | - operational: strategy-first mandate; operational: capital-allocation framework
Owner: Head of Corporate Development / CEO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3977_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3977_Annotation9" targetRef="W3977_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3977_Flow11" sourceRef="W3977_Start4" targetRef="W3977_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3977_Flow12" sourceRef="W3977_Task5" targetRef="W3977_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3977_Flow13" sourceRef="W3977_Task6" targetRef="W3977_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3977_Flow14" sourceRef="W3977_Task7" targetRef="W3977_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
