    <bpmn:process id="W_W3979" name="W3979. Acquisition Target Sourcing, Pipeline &amp; Deal Origination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy mandate; market scan; inbound approach
Frequency: Continuous pipeline
Volume: Maintained pipeline of opportunities
Owner: Head of Corporate Development
Participants: Corp Dev, Strategy (links to VS-33.3), Insights (links to VS-44), business units, external advisors/bankers, Legal (links to VS-100)
Source: workflow W3979 — Acquisition Target Sourcing, Pipeline &amp; Deal Origination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3979_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3979_Lane1" name="Corp Dev">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3979_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3979_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3979_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3979_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3979_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3979_Start3" name="Strategy mandate; market scan; inbound approach">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3979_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3979_Task4" name="Corp Dev maintain the acquisition/JV pipeline: market mapping of targets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev maintain the acquisition/JV pipeline: market mapping of targets (competitor chains, regional banners, specialty retailers, service/installation/design businesses, digital/fintech adjacencies), sourcing channels (direct, advisors/bankers, industry networks), and inbound-offer triage
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Strategy / Insights
Accountable (A): Head of Corp Dev
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3979_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3979_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3979_Task5" name="Corp Dev build relationships with target owners/principals (many are…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corp Dev build relationships with target owners/principals (many are privately/family-held like BuildRight), assess readiness and willingness, and manage confidentiality/NDAs (links to VS-100) and any ABC screening (links to VS-86/VS-119)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Corp Dev
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3979_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3979_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3979_Task6" name="Corp Dev prioritize the pipeline against strategy/capacity, refresh regularly…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Corp Dev prioritize the pipeline against strategy/capacity, refresh regularly, and report to the CEO/Board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3979_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3979_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3979_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3979_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3979_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-620 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Development Strategy, Pipeline &amp; Target Identification (PA-130.1).) | - operational: active market mapping; operational: ABC screening
Owner: Head of Corporate Development</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
