      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3981_Task5" name="Corp Dev/Finance build the deal financial model: standalone financials…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev/Finance build the deal financial model: standalone financials (revenue, EBITDA, FCF), synergy cases (revenue/cost/financial), integration cost, financing structure, and returns (NPV/IRR/payback/ROIC) consistent with BuildRight&#x27;s standards (links to VS-40/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3981_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3981_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3981_Task6" name="Corp Dev/external-advisors determine valuation using multiple methods (DCF…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corp Dev/external-advisors determine valuation using multiple methods (DCF, trading comps, transaction comps, asset-based) and establish the offer range and walk-away price; assess financing mix (cash, debt links to VS-18, equity) and covenant/liquidity impact
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Treasury / external advisors
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3981_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3981_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3981_Task7" name="CFO/Corp-Dev present the valuation and financing plan to the approval authority…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO/Corp-Dev present the valuation and financing plan to the approval authority (links to W3983), and set the negotiation envelope (links to W3982)
Responsible (R): CFO / Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3981_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3981_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
