        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev/Legal structure the transaction: asset vs share purchase, entity/legal structure (within the 5-entity group or new entity), consideration (cash/deferred/earn-out/equity), working-capital mechanism, retention/escrow, reps &amp; warranties, indemnities, conditions precedent, and exclusivity/confidentiality
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Legal / Tax / Finance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
