Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per target</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3982_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3982_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
