      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3983_Task5" name="Corp Dev/CEO operate the stage-gate process: defined gates (strategy, screen…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev/CEO operate the stage-gate process: defined gates (strategy, screen, valuation, LOI, DD, SPA, close, integration), decision criteria, documentation, and the approval-authority matrix by deal size (CEO → Board → shareholders) tied to BuildRight&#x27;s authority matrix (links to VS-36 governance)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / CEO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Per gate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3983_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3983_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3983_Task6" name="Board/Audit-Committee review material transactions (strategic fit, valuation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Board/Audit-Committee review material transactions (strategic fit, valuation, risks, financing, competition clearance links to W3967, integration plan links to PA-130.3) and approve/decline at each binding gate
Responsible (R): Board / Audit Committee
Accountable (A): Board / Shareholders
Duration: Per gate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3983_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3983_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3983_Task7" name="Corp Dev/Legal document decisions, maintain the deal file and audit trail…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Corp Dev/Legal document decisions, maintain the deal file and audit trail (links to VS-88/VS-21), and ensure disclosure to debt-holders/lenders where covenants require (links to VS-18)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per gate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3983_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3983_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
