    <bpmn:process id="W_W3984" name="W3984. M&amp;A Project Setup, Deal Team &amp; Deal Management Office" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: LOI execution / binding gate
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Per transaction
Owner: Head of Corporate Development
Participants: Corp Dev (deal lead), Legal, Finance, Tax, HR, IT, affected business unit, Strategy, Integration Lead, external advisors, PMO (links to VS-112)
Source: workflow W3984 — M&amp;A Project Setup, Deal Team &amp; Deal Management Office</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3984_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3984_Lane1" name="Corp Dev">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3984_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3984_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3984_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3984_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3984_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3984_Start3" name="LOI execution / binding gate">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3984_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3984_Task4" name="Corp Dev stand up the deal team and deal management office (DMO): deal lead…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev stand up the deal team and deal management office (DMO): deal lead, workstream leads (legal, finance, tax, HR, IT, commercial, integration), external advisors, RACI, cadence, deal room/data room, and reporting (leveraging PMO discipline links to VS-112)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3984_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3984_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3984_Task5" name="Corp Dev establish the deal plan and controls: timeline, milestones, workstream…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corp Dev establish the deal plan and controls: timeline, milestones, workstream plans, risk log, budget, info-barrier/clean-team protocols (links to VS-129), and communications plan (internal links to VS-103.1; external links to VS-14.3)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Integration Lead
Accountable (A): Head of Corp Dev
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3984_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3984_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3984_Task6" name="Corp Dev run the deal cadence, track milestones and risks to close, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Corp Dev run the deal cadence, track milestones and risks to close, and transition to integration (links to PA-130.3)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3984_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3984_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3984_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3984_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3984_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-620 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Development Strategy, Pipeline &amp; Target Identification (PA-130.1).) | - operational: DMO and PMO discipline; operational: clean-team and comms controls
Owner: Head of Corporate Development</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
